# CR 709.5: a Room's doors lock and unlock independently. human's Bottomless
# Pool // Locker Room has only Locker Room (RightSplit) unlocked. Marina
# Vendrell's sorcery-speed ability (UnlockDoor Mode$ LockOrUnlock) targets it;
# with one door locked human may pick either door, and picks the locked
# LeftSplit, which unlocks. Bottomless Pool's own "When you unlock this door"
# (Mode$ UnlockDoor, ThisDoor$ True) then triggers and returns ai's Grizzly
# Bears to its owner's hand. Both doors end unlocked.
startturn human
advance 3
queue targets 2
queue action human activate 1 0
queue roomdoor LeftSplit
queue targets 3
passpriority
